Just tested this in wizard mode (you can do this yourself, you know...).

I started up a ranger, who have the following spell groups: healing,
divination and escape. Next, I wished for a neutral altar, and started
praying, forcing the gods to be pleased.

After some 600 moves, and lots of prayers, I had gained some 10 points of
protection, I was given the castle tune, I had searching and telepathy,
and had gained lots of spellbooks, in the following order:

